WEBVTT

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:08.142 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

00:00:33.917 --> 00:00:35.002 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:00:38.088 --> 00:00:39.631 line:80%
CHARACTERS, EVENTS, ORGANIZATIONS,
AND PLACES IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:00:39.715 --> 00:00:41.008 line:80%
ALL CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS
FILMED IN A SAFE ENVIRONMENT

00:00:41.091 --> 00:00:42.092 line:80%
[Haran] Huh?

00:00:42.176 --> 00:00:43.844 line:20%
EPISODE 11

00:00:44.428 --> 00:00:45.429 line:20%
[chuckles softly]

00:00:59.943 --> 00:01:02.780 line:20%
THANKS FOR THE

00:01:19.046 --> 00:01:20.881 line:80%
[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:01:20.964 --> 00:01:22.216 line:20%
Kang Hyeokchan…

00:01:22.299 --> 00:01:24.468 line:20%
KANG HYEOKCHAN
GLASS TUBE

00:01:25.260 --> 00:01:27.429 line:20%
Why is this name here?

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:33.852 line:20%
Hospitalized? Hyeokchan?

00:01:33.936 --> 00:01:35.729 line:80%
He hurt his hand badly in the lab.

00:01:35.813 --> 00:01:37.189 line:80%
He even got surgery.

00:01:38.023 --> 00:01:40.901 line:80%
How does he know Hyeokchan?

00:01:43.112 --> 00:01:44.780 line:80%
OUTSIDE THE LAB

00:01:45.322 --> 00:01:46.865 line:80%
"Lab"?

00:01:47.491 --> 00:01:48.659 line:80%
[Chan] <i>NaClO.</i>

00:01:48.742 --> 00:01:50.077 line:80%
Sodium hypochlorite…

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.745 line:80%
[officer] I guess
you majored in that field.

00:01:51.829 --> 00:01:54.081 line:80%
It seems like you majored
in engineering, not art.

00:01:57.793 --> 00:01:59.003 line:80%
Huh?

00:01:59.086 --> 00:02:00.254 line:80%
This is…

00:02:01.171 --> 00:02:04.341 line:80%
[Sujin] <i>I'm only visiting, so I'm not</i>
<i>authorized to treat patients directly.</i>

00:02:04.425 --> 00:02:05.551 line:80%
I came from Boston.

00:02:07.344 --> 00:02:08.345 line:80%
[stutters] Boston?

00:02:09.722 --> 00:02:10.889 line:80%
[sighs]

00:02:14.143 --> 00:02:15.853 line:80%
[Seok] <i>There was</i>
<i>an international conference.</i>

00:02:15.936 --> 00:02:17.271 line:80%
Your school…

00:02:17.730 --> 00:02:21.483 line:80%
-No, your former school…
-[Chan] That's enough.

00:02:26.905 --> 00:02:28.407 line:80%
Boston Institute of Technology.

00:02:35.873 --> 00:02:38.083 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:02:39.877 --> 00:02:40.878 line:80%
[Genius huffs]

00:02:41.545 --> 00:02:42.546 line:80%
Ah.

00:02:44.298 --> 00:02:45.341 line:80%
[sighs]

00:02:46.467 --> 00:02:47.468 line:80%
Is she upstairs?

00:02:49.845 --> 00:02:51.430 line:80%
THANKS FOR THE

00:02:53.307 --> 00:02:55.934 line:80%
-[line connects, ringing]
-[inhales sharply]

00:03:02.066 --> 00:03:03.067 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:03:10.282 --> 00:03:12.618 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:03:17.831 --> 00:03:19.500 line:80%
KANG HYEOKCHAN, GLASS TUBE, BLOOD

00:03:19.583 --> 00:03:22.044 line:80%
KANG HYEOKCHAN HOSPITALIZED, WOMAN
THAT SOUND WAS HER BRACELET

00:03:32.221 --> 00:03:34.139 line:80%
[exhales shakily] No…

00:03:44.024 --> 00:03:45.442 line:80%
[Hyeokchan]
<i>Let me tell you something cool.</i>

00:03:45.526 --> 00:03:48.153 line:80%
<i>My dorm roommate is Korean,</i>
<i>and his name's Chan, too.</i>

00:03:48.237 --> 00:03:50.322 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>You used to call him Chan.</i>

00:03:50.406 --> 00:03:52.366 line:80%
<i>Your old boyfriend, Hyeokchan.</i>

00:03:53.075 --> 00:03:54.201 line:80%
Hyeokchan's roommate

00:03:55.202 --> 00:03:58.414 line:80%
was Seonu Chan?

00:03:58.497 --> 00:03:59.707 line:80%
[vibrating]

00:03:59.790 --> 00:04:01.291 line:80%
SEONU CHAN

00:04:02.668 --> 00:04:03.669 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Watch out!</i>

00:04:03.752 --> 00:04:04.878 line:80%
Song Haran!

00:04:05.879 --> 00:04:07.923 line:80%
[Haran] I met you for the first time
a few days ago.

00:04:08.007 --> 00:04:09.883 line:80%
How long have you known me?

00:04:10.384 --> 00:04:12.761 line:80%
Tell me how you know me.

00:04:12.845 --> 00:04:14.388 line:80%
What are you hiding?

00:04:17.099 --> 00:04:18.309 line:80%
He's known me

00:04:19.685 --> 00:04:20.894 line:80%
for seven years.

00:04:23.981 --> 00:04:25.107 line:80%
[door closes]

00:04:30.738 --> 00:04:31.739 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:04:35.075 --> 00:04:37.077 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:46.045 line:80%
[Haran] <i>He knew my face</i>

00:04:47.004 --> 00:04:48.881 line:80%
and my name.

00:04:50.090 --> 00:04:51.216 line:80%
It's nice to meet you.

00:04:51.300 --> 00:04:52.301 line:80%
Ah…

00:04:53.135 --> 00:04:54.303 line:80%
It's nice to meet you.

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:58.265 line:80%
I saw you up close earlier,
looking at the Sisley painting.

00:04:59.892 --> 00:05:01.060 line:80%
No…

00:05:01.644 --> 00:05:03.312 line:80%
This can't be right. No.

00:05:04.021 --> 00:05:05.022 line:80%
No…

00:05:05.105 --> 00:05:06.607 line:80%
<i>Hey, it smells like rain.</i>

00:05:06.690 --> 00:05:08.942 line:80%
[Chan] <i>That's the smell</i>
<i>of organic matter diffusing.</i>

00:05:09.026 --> 00:05:10.277 line:80%
Petrichor.

00:05:10.361 --> 00:05:13.072 line:80%
[Haran] <i>There's another guy</i>
<i>who speaks like him.</i>

00:05:13.822 --> 00:05:15.407 line:80%
She doesn't like eggplants.

00:05:15.491 --> 00:05:17.284 line:80%
[Haran] How do you know
I don't like eggplants?

00:05:17.368 --> 00:05:19.078 line:80%
<i>Yuck. The taste of neon alien.</i>

00:05:19.161 --> 00:05:20.412 line:80%
I'll eat those for you.

00:05:20.954 --> 00:05:22.039 line:80%
The neon aliens.

00:05:23.666 --> 00:05:24.750 line:80%
Then…

00:05:26.085 --> 00:05:27.336 line:80%
all those messages…

00:05:28.754 --> 00:05:30.422 line:80%
were him pretending to be Hyeokchan?

00:05:36.637 --> 00:05:37.930 line:80%
[exhales shakily]

00:05:38.013 --> 00:05:39.014 line:80%
No…

00:05:40.057 --> 00:05:41.934 line:80%
That can't be. No.

00:05:42.017 --> 00:05:43.143 line:80%
He'll explain everything.

00:05:43.227 --> 00:05:44.436 line:80%
No…

00:05:44.520 --> 00:05:45.771 line:80%
This doesn't make sense.

00:05:45.854 --> 00:05:47.272 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:06:01.537 --> 00:06:03.080 line:80%
-[cell phone vibrates]
-[Chan] <i>Let's meet.</i>

00:06:03.163 --> 00:06:04.331 line:80%
<i>Let's meet up and talk.</i>

00:06:04.415 --> 00:06:05.791 line:80%
<i>I'll explain everything.</i>

00:06:10.295 --> 00:06:11.630 line:80%
No, please…

00:06:12.131 --> 00:06:13.132 line:80%
Please.

00:06:13.716 --> 00:06:14.717 line:80%
Please…

00:06:25.853 --> 00:06:28.480 line:80%
It must have gotten mixed up
in my stuff back then.

00:06:29.273 --> 00:06:31.275 line:80%
<i>Just consider this pen</i>

00:06:31.358 --> 00:06:32.401 line:80%
<i>a pen that I found for you.</i>

00:06:35.154 --> 00:06:37.573 line:80%
I think you owe me an explanation.

00:06:37.656 --> 00:06:39.283 line:80%
I bought the same pen…

00:06:42.161 --> 00:06:43.620 line:80%
when I was in the States.

00:06:44.621 --> 00:06:45.831 line:80%
Then this pen…

00:06:47.374 --> 00:06:49.126 line:80%
He knew everything…

00:06:52.212 --> 00:06:53.547 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:07:03.223 --> 00:07:04.642 line:80%
[sighs]

00:07:06.769 --> 00:07:07.770 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:07:17.946 --> 00:07:19.448 line:80%
-Hey…
-[Haran] Don't come any closer.

00:07:28.582 --> 00:07:30.167 line:80%
Boston Institute of Technology.

00:07:30.959 --> 00:07:32.378 line:80%
Kang Hyeokchan's roommate.

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:34.713 line:80%
Have you really known me

00:07:35.881 --> 00:07:37.257 line:80%
for seven years?

00:07:41.178 --> 00:07:42.596 line:80%
[breathes shakily]

00:07:43.764 --> 00:07:45.432 line:80%
-Song Haran.
-Don't say my name.

00:07:45.933 --> 00:07:46.976 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:07:47.059 --> 00:07:48.143 line:80%
Did you have fun

00:07:48.978 --> 00:07:50.604 line:80%
pretending to be Kang Hyeokchan?

00:07:50.688 --> 00:07:51.897 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:07:57.111 --> 00:07:58.487 line:80%
Seonu Chan,

00:07:59.488 --> 00:08:00.572 line:80%
who are you?

00:08:01.281 --> 00:08:03.283 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:08:06.453 --> 00:08:07.913 line:80%
The Seonu Chan

00:08:07.997 --> 00:08:10.708 line:80%
I liked and trusted
until just a few hours ago…

00:08:10.791 --> 00:08:12.292 line:80%
Who is he, really?

00:08:14.753 --> 00:08:16.296 line:80%
[yells] Who are you?

00:08:16.380 --> 00:08:17.881 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:08:17.965 --> 00:08:19.383 line:80%
[stutters]

00:08:19.842 --> 00:08:21.135 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:08:21.677 --> 00:08:24.013 line:80%
I shouldn't have let you
find out like this.

00:08:24.555 --> 00:08:25.848 line:80%
I should've told you…

00:08:25.931 --> 00:08:28.600 line:80%
No wonder you were so flustered
in front of the doctor.

00:08:29.310 --> 00:08:31.020 line:80%
You didn't want to get caught,

00:08:32.146 --> 00:08:34.565 line:80%
because she knew you were in Boston.

00:08:35.482 --> 00:08:36.984 line:80%
Because I couldn't find out.

00:08:37.693 --> 00:08:39.695 line:80%
-I'll explain everything.
-Tell me.

00:08:40.988 --> 00:08:42.156 line:80%
Did you message me

00:08:42.865 --> 00:08:44.950 line:80%
seven years ago,
pretending to be Hyeokchan?

00:08:45.617 --> 00:08:46.785 line:80%
Is that true?

00:08:50.789 --> 00:08:51.790 line:80%
Answer me.

00:08:53.917 --> 00:08:57.588 line:80%
Did you really deceive me
and pretend to be Hyeokchan

00:08:58.756 --> 00:08:59.923 line:80%
behind his back?

00:09:04.553 --> 00:09:05.554 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:09:07.222 --> 00:09:08.223 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:09:09.224 --> 00:09:10.225 line:80%
Why?

00:09:12.227 --> 00:09:13.270 line:80%
Why did you do that?

00:09:16.315 --> 00:09:17.316 line:80%
Our laptops

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.569 line:80%
got switched once.

00:09:20.653 --> 00:09:21.737 line:80%
[sighs in disbelief]

00:09:23.405 --> 00:09:24.490 line:80%
[exhales shakily]

00:09:25.783 --> 00:09:27.868 line:80%
Did you have fun
chatting with me like that?

00:09:28.786 --> 00:09:31.747 line:80%
Did you build some kind of fantasy
and start liking me?

00:09:31.830 --> 00:09:34.208 line:80%
I can't even tell
which was really Hyeokchan or you…

00:09:43.175 --> 00:09:44.176 line:80%
The pen.

00:09:46.804 --> 00:09:47.805 line:80%
The engraving.

00:09:50.015 --> 00:09:51.016 line:80%
Who was it?

00:09:51.517 --> 00:09:53.185 line:80%
Was it you or Hyeokchan?

00:09:58.023 --> 00:10:00.025 line:80%
-I'm sorry.
-[exhales shakily]

00:10:02.111 --> 00:10:03.112 line:80%
If that's fake…

00:10:04.488 --> 00:10:06.365 line:80%
[sobbing] Even if this pen is fake…

00:10:07.241 --> 00:10:09.785 line:80%
Then what was I holding onto
the past seven years?

00:10:10.911 --> 00:10:13.539 line:80%
I even hurt my grandma
because of all that.

00:10:13.622 --> 00:10:14.623 line:80%
Why…

00:10:16.417 --> 00:10:18.335 line:80%
You should've at least told me

00:10:19.378 --> 00:10:21.588 line:80%
when you gave me this pen.

00:10:21.672 --> 00:10:26.135 line:80%
When I believed you like a fool,
you should've told me the truth.

00:10:26.218 --> 00:10:27.428 line:80%
I needed time.

00:10:28.303 --> 00:10:29.388 line:80%
My memories aren't…

00:10:32.224 --> 00:10:33.309 line:80%
[sighs exasperatedly]

00:10:34.101 --> 00:10:35.102 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:37.271 line:80%
It's all my fault.

00:10:37.354 --> 00:10:40.024 line:80%
Do you even know what it meant
for me to hold your hand?

00:10:40.107 --> 00:10:42.151 line:80%
To open my heart to you?

00:10:42.234 --> 00:10:44.320 line:80%
[sighs] How could you, of all people…

00:10:44.403 --> 00:10:46.447 line:80%
How could you, Seonu Chan?

00:10:47.197 --> 00:10:48.324 line:80%
[sighs dejectedly]

00:10:49.575 --> 00:10:52.494 line:80%
I'm really sorry I hurt you
by making you find out like this.

00:10:53.912 --> 00:10:55.998 line:80%
I won't ask you
to believe everything I say,

00:10:56.081 --> 00:10:57.166 line:80%
so please…

00:10:57.249 --> 00:11:01.086 line:80%
I was surprised that there was someone
who believed in me this much.

00:11:02.338 --> 00:11:03.339 line:80%
I was grateful.

00:11:04.715 --> 00:11:06.633 line:80%
But you knew me all along.

00:11:07.676 --> 00:11:09.178 line:80%
You knew what hurt me the most

00:11:09.678 --> 00:11:11.680 line:80%
and what would break me the easiest.

00:11:13.015 --> 00:11:14.099 line:80%
I thought…

00:11:17.728 --> 00:11:19.396 line:80%
you were like a miracle to me.

00:11:21.565 --> 00:11:23.108 line:80%
But to you…

00:11:25.069 --> 00:11:26.904 line:80%
I was just an experiment.

00:11:29.448 --> 00:11:30.699 line:80%
[Chan sighs dejectedly]

00:11:31.742 --> 00:11:32.951 line:80%
It's not…

00:11:34.787 --> 00:11:35.913 line:80%
No…

00:11:38.415 --> 00:11:39.416 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:40.959 line:80%
Haran, that's not true.

00:11:41.043 --> 00:11:42.294 line:80%
Never.

00:11:42.795 --> 00:11:45.422 line:80%
If you were fake,
you shouldn't have made me like you.

00:11:46.006 --> 00:11:48.384 line:80%
You shouldn't have made me
trust you this much!

00:11:51.679 --> 00:11:53.597 line:80%
I didn't even know it was all fake,

00:11:53.681 --> 00:11:55.432 line:80%
and I foolishly laughed, cried,

00:11:55.516 --> 00:11:58.143 line:80%
and was happy because of you.

00:11:58.227 --> 00:12:00.229 line:80%
[Haran sobbing]

00:12:00.813 --> 00:12:04.149 line:80%
It must have been so fun watching me.

00:12:04.984 --> 00:12:06.360 line:80%
Like a spring picnic.

00:12:16.912 --> 00:12:17.913 line:80%
[Chan pants]

00:12:18.539 --> 00:12:19.915 line:80%
Wait.

00:12:21.291 --> 00:12:22.459 line:80%
Please.

00:12:22.543 --> 00:12:25.796 line:80%
[panting] Please, let me explain.

00:12:25.879 --> 00:12:26.880 line:80%
Explain what?

00:12:27.965 --> 00:12:30.092 line:80%
That you were still sincere?
That's so obvious.

00:12:31.468 --> 00:12:34.430 line:80%
No matter what you say about it,
the truth won't change.

00:12:34.513 --> 00:12:36.307 line:80%
Everything was fake from the start,

00:12:37.141 --> 00:12:39.351 line:80%
and every moment you spent with me,

00:12:40.144 --> 00:12:42.062 line:80%
you were hiding that secret from me.

00:12:43.522 --> 00:12:44.940 line:80%
[♪ melancholy music playing]

00:12:45.024 --> 00:12:46.442 line:80%
I knew it was too good to be true.

00:12:46.942 --> 00:12:49.236 line:80%
There's no way
someone like me could be that happy.

00:12:49.903 --> 00:12:53.615 line:80%
Whenever I feel like I'm really happy,

00:12:53.699 --> 00:12:54.783 line:80%
I lose someone.

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:57.661 line:80%
[young Hadam] Hi!

00:12:57.745 --> 00:12:59.621 line:80%
-[Hyewon] Hi.
-[Junho] They look so excited.

00:13:00.164 --> 00:13:01.165 line:80%
[tires screech]

00:13:01.248 --> 00:13:02.624 line:80%
Dad!

00:13:02.708 --> 00:13:03.959 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Mom and Dad, 13 years ago…</i>

00:13:04.043 --> 00:13:05.419 line:80%
[gasps, sighs]

00:13:05.502 --> 00:13:06.754 line:80%
Just five minutes left.

00:13:06.837 --> 00:13:09.298 line:80%
-[people clamoring]
-[siren blaring]

00:13:10.132 --> 00:13:11.425 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Hyeokchan, seven years ago…</i>

00:13:12.092 --> 00:13:13.218 line:80%
And today.

00:13:13.844 --> 00:13:15.637 line:80%
You, Seonu Chan.

00:13:18.974 --> 00:13:21.185 line:80%
This is the kind of ending that suits me.

00:13:21.810 --> 00:13:23.812 line:80%
I'm not allowed to be happy.

00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:27.232 line:80%
You've proven that once again.

00:13:27.941 --> 00:13:30.027 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:13:30.110 --> 00:13:31.111 line:80%
Haran, please.

00:13:31.862 --> 00:13:33.238 line:80%
If we end things like this,

00:13:33.822 --> 00:13:37.242 line:80%
you'll go back
to putting up walls around you.

00:13:38.035 --> 00:13:40.162 line:80%
-If you do that because of me--
-You're right.

00:13:41.205 --> 00:13:43.457 line:80%
You just pushed me back into winter again.

00:13:44.333 --> 00:13:46.377 line:80%
My past seven years, the present,

00:13:47.336 --> 00:13:48.671 line:80%
and the future.

00:13:48.754 --> 00:13:49.755 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:13:49.838 --> 00:13:51.507 line:80%
You've ruined it all for me.

00:13:55.135 --> 00:13:56.970 line:80%
[sighs] Just let me go.

00:13:58.305 --> 00:13:59.431 line:80%
You disgust me.

00:14:09.942 --> 00:14:11.944 line:80%
[♪ mellow song playing]

00:14:22.871 --> 00:14:24.873 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:14:42.266 --> 00:14:43.600 line:80%
[sharp inhale, groans]

00:14:46.228 --> 00:14:48.230 line:80%
[sobbing]

00:14:56.822 --> 00:14:58.532 line:80%
[sobbing]

00:15:05.331 --> 00:15:07.333 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Is it still valid?</i>

00:15:07.416 --> 00:15:09.293 line:80%
Being friends. The three-month trial.

00:15:09.376 --> 00:15:11.962 line:80%
Then let's do this.
It'll be like we're on a spring picnic.

00:15:12.046 --> 00:15:13.047 line:80%
Let's have fun.

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.631 line:80%
<i>Ms. Song!</i>

00:15:23.098 --> 00:15:25.476 line:80%
You're Designer Song Haran, right?

00:15:26.310 --> 00:15:27.311 line:80%
[Haran chuckles]

00:15:31.231 --> 00:15:33.150 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I'll wear this every day.</i>

00:15:33.233 --> 00:15:34.985 line:80%
[Haran shudders]

00:15:35.778 --> 00:15:36.779 line:80%
[Haran chuckles]

00:15:37.905 --> 00:15:39.657 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I feel like I'm in a dream.</i>

00:15:41.450 --> 00:15:42.618 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:45.788 line:80%
[♪ song continues]

00:15:45.871 --> 00:15:48.540 line:80%
[inaudible]

00:15:57.675 --> 00:15:59.551 line:80%
[wind whooshes]

00:15:59.635 --> 00:16:02.596 line:80%
-[leaves rustling]
-[birds chirping]

00:16:02.680 --> 00:16:04.598 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

00:16:04.682 --> 00:16:06.600 line:80%
-[♪ song fades]
-[pens clatter]

00:16:08.852 --> 00:16:10.229 line:80%
[objects clattering]

00:16:15.275 --> 00:16:16.276 line:80%
SEONU CHAN

00:16:31.875 --> 00:16:32.960 line:80%
[sighs]

00:16:36.422 --> 00:16:37.423 line:80%
[sighs]

00:16:41.301 --> 00:16:43.303 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:17:04.450 --> 00:17:06.577 line:80%
[Haran] <i>I'm not allowed to be happy.</i>

00:17:07.703 --> 00:17:09.455 line:80%
You've proven that once again.

00:17:10.247 --> 00:17:12.458 line:80%
<i>You just pushed me back into winter again.</i>

00:17:12.541 --> 00:17:15.336 line:80%
<i>My past seven years, the present,</i>

00:17:15.419 --> 00:17:16.628 line:80%
<i>and the future.</i>

00:17:16.712 --> 00:17:18.547 line:80%
<i>You've ruined it all for me.</i>

00:17:19.757 --> 00:17:21.300 line:80%
It's my fault…

00:17:24.803 --> 00:17:26.680 line:80%
I have to do something.

00:17:29.141 --> 00:17:30.142 line:80%
[exclaims softly]

00:17:31.185 --> 00:17:33.896 line:80%
Talk it out with Haran.

00:17:33.979 --> 00:17:38.525 line:80%
If you're sincere,
I'm sure she'll understand.

00:17:38.609 --> 00:17:40.027 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:17:55.292 --> 00:17:56.293 line:80%
[sighs]

00:18:03.759 --> 00:18:04.760 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:18:04.843 --> 00:18:06.345 line:80%
-[knocks on door]
-[Hayeong] Haran?

00:18:07.805 --> 00:18:09.348 line:80%
What's going on?

00:18:09.431 --> 00:18:11.308 line:80%
Why are you cooped up in here again?

00:18:11.892 --> 00:18:13.727 line:80%
How is this scarf? Should I wear it?

00:18:15.062 --> 00:18:17.481 line:80%
I'm heading to work in 10 minutes.
Do you want to…

00:18:20.651 --> 00:18:21.652 line:80%
What?

00:18:22.611 --> 00:18:23.904 line:80%
You're sweating.

00:18:25.739 --> 00:18:27.950 line:80%
Haran, you're burning up.

00:18:28.951 --> 00:18:30.995 line:80%
I told you to dress warmly, didn't I?

00:18:31.078 --> 00:18:33.580 line:80%
-Let's go to the hospital.
-I can just take medicine.

00:18:33.664 --> 00:18:35.499 line:80%
Medicine won't be enough right now.

00:18:36.250 --> 00:18:37.835 line:80%
You should just rest today…

00:18:37.918 --> 00:18:40.379 line:80%
How can I when Grandma's away?

00:18:40.963 --> 00:18:43.173 line:80%
I'll get dressed, so get the car ready.

00:18:43.257 --> 00:18:44.508 line:80%
[Hayeong sighs softly]

00:18:51.140 --> 00:18:52.891 line:80%
Oh… Let's talk.

00:18:53.517 --> 00:18:56.145 line:80%
[pants] I know you don't want to see me…

00:18:56.228 --> 00:18:58.188 line:80%
[stutters] but just hear me out.

00:18:58.272 --> 00:19:01.859 line:80%
If we end things like this,
you'll go back to how you used to be.

00:19:05.195 --> 00:19:06.196 line:80%
All right.

00:19:07.031 --> 00:19:09.325 line:80%
You don't have to look at me
or listen to me.

00:19:09.408 --> 00:19:11.910 line:80%
So please, just look at this.

00:19:15.998 --> 00:19:18.625 line:80%
-[Chan stutters]
-How many pills should you take?

00:19:18.709 --> 00:19:21.587 line:80%
-Oh? It's Chan.
-Don't open the window. Just go.

00:19:22.087 --> 00:19:24.006 line:80%
-But it's Chan.
-Just go.

00:19:24.715 --> 00:19:25.758 line:80%
Okay.

00:19:30.471 --> 00:19:33.140 line:80%
If he came all the way here,
it must be pretty important.

00:19:33.932 --> 00:19:35.851 line:80%
What's going on? Did you have a fight?

00:19:36.810 --> 00:19:38.187 line:80%
Let's just go quietly.

00:19:39.188 --> 00:19:41.982 line:80%
He looks so down, though.

00:19:44.026 --> 00:19:45.235 line:80%
[Hayeong sighs]

00:19:48.656 --> 00:19:50.658 line:80%
Let's continue after lunch.

00:19:50.741 --> 00:19:53.035 line:80%
-All right.
-[groans]

00:19:53.118 --> 00:19:54.703 line:80%
[Haran] Can you--

00:19:54.787 --> 00:19:56.038 line:80%
It's Chan.

00:19:56.121 --> 00:19:57.164 line:80%
Hey, Chan.

00:20:05.214 --> 00:20:06.256 line:80%
Ms. Song.

00:20:06.340 --> 00:20:07.925 line:80%
I don't have any meetings today.

00:20:08.008 --> 00:20:09.385 line:80%
Don't let anyone in.

00:20:10.010 --> 00:20:11.970 line:80%
[Sol] Huh? But Chan…

00:20:12.471 --> 00:20:14.306 line:80%
[Chan] I won't make any excuses.

00:20:14.390 --> 00:20:17.267 line:80%
I know you don't want to listen,
so please…

00:20:17.351 --> 00:20:19.561 line:80%
No exceptions.
Don't let anyone in my office.

00:20:29.989 --> 00:20:32.157 line:80%
[♪ melancholy music playing]

00:20:32.241 --> 00:20:35.703 line:80%
[hesitates] I'll buy lunch today.

00:20:36.286 --> 00:20:37.913 line:80%
Why don't you join us since you're here?

00:20:38.539 --> 00:20:40.416 line:80%
No, I'm okay.

00:20:43.711 --> 00:20:44.712 line:80%
Ah.

00:20:45.212 --> 00:20:47.881 line:80%
Please give this to her.
Don't tell her it's from me.

00:20:47.965 --> 00:20:49.174 line:80%
[Raemee] Okay.

00:20:50.092 --> 00:20:51.927 line:80%
He looks more sick than her, though.

00:21:02.855 --> 00:21:03.856 line:80%
[sighs]

00:21:12.489 --> 00:21:13.490 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:21:15.117 --> 00:21:16.910 line:80%
Does this one stand out too much?

00:21:18.704 --> 00:21:20.789 line:80%
[Seunggyu] It'll feel more like noise
than a focal point.

00:21:20.873 --> 00:21:22.124 line:80%
What do you think?

00:21:22.750 --> 00:21:23.834 line:80%
I agree.

00:21:23.917 --> 00:21:25.753 line:80%
Then let's stick to the flow instead.

00:21:25.836 --> 00:21:27.129 line:80%
-All right.
-Good.

00:21:28.339 --> 00:21:32.676 line:80%
Oh. But has anyone
seen our robot, Mr. Yeon?

00:21:32.760 --> 00:21:36.055 line:80%
I have to ask him
about our press cut deadline. [sighs]

00:21:36.138 --> 00:21:39.892 line:80%
I haven't seen
his perfectly groomed hair for days.

00:21:39.975 --> 00:21:42.895 line:80%
He must be incredibly busy
taking care of things for Ms. Kim.

00:21:42.978 --> 00:21:46.732 line:80%
Right. He'll be busy
making up for her absence.

00:21:47.232 --> 00:21:50.277 line:80%
But when did Mr. Yeon
start working in Nana Atelier?

00:21:51.111 --> 00:21:52.112 line:80%
Since he was 19.

00:21:52.738 --> 00:21:53.739 line:80%
[Seunggyu, Sol, and Raemee gasp]

00:21:53.822 --> 00:21:55.824 line:80%
-Nineteen?
-[in English] Legend.

00:21:55.908 --> 00:21:57.618 line:80%
[Sol exclaims, whines]

00:21:57.701 --> 00:22:01.038 line:80%
[in Korean] But no matter how busy he is,
he does seem to have disappeared.

00:22:01.121 --> 00:22:03.248 line:80%
-[Seunggyu] Mmm.
-Right.

00:22:03.749 --> 00:22:04.833 line:80%
It's like he just quit.

00:22:04.917 --> 00:22:06.919 line:80%
[Sol gasps] What if he really did?

00:22:07.586 --> 00:22:09.588 line:80%
[♪ mellow music playing]

00:22:12.257 --> 00:22:15.177 line:80%
[Sol] He could have,
if he's been working since he was 19.

00:22:17.429 --> 00:22:18.430 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:22:19.056 --> 00:22:21.767 line:80%
I organized the color differences
and confirmed the pigment.

00:22:21.850 --> 00:22:24.061 line:80%
I also picked the other SS looks.

00:22:24.144 --> 00:22:26.355 line:80%
And you need to approve this.

00:22:31.318 --> 00:22:32.820 line:80%
How are you feeling?

00:22:35.781 --> 00:22:38.117 line:80%
-I should ask the same thing.
-What?

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:40.160 line:80%
You look really unwell.

00:22:40.244 --> 00:22:43.497 line:80%
-Oh… I just have a light cold.
-That's not all, is it?

00:22:44.748 --> 00:22:45.749 line:80%
What is it?

00:22:45.833 --> 00:22:50.045 line:80%
Has Mr. Seonu gotten worse?

00:22:51.046 --> 00:22:53.632 line:80%
No, nothing's wrong. [chuckles awkwardly]

00:22:53.716 --> 00:22:57.386 line:80%
Just focus on your condition
before your surgery.

00:22:57.469 --> 00:22:59.513 line:80%
Don't worry about me or the company.

00:23:00.347 --> 00:23:02.975 line:80%
Mr. Park, you can head home today.
I'll stay here.

00:23:03.058 --> 00:23:04.059 line:80%
[Manjae] Mmm-mmm.

00:23:04.643 --> 00:23:07.396 line:80%
I told you I'm in charge here.

00:23:07.479 --> 00:23:11.358 line:80%
You should hurry home and rest.

00:23:11.442 --> 00:23:13.777 line:80%
[Nana] You might end up
getting hospitalized instead of me.

00:23:13.861 --> 00:23:15.487 line:80%
You look like you'll collapse.

00:23:15.571 --> 00:23:16.864 line:80%
Go home.

00:23:17.323 --> 00:23:19.283 line:80%
Then please take care of her.

00:23:20.159 --> 00:23:21.577 line:80%
Thank you, Mr. Park.

00:23:22.328 --> 00:23:23.329 line:80%
[in English] My pleasure.

00:23:23.412 --> 00:23:24.747 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:23:24.830 --> 00:23:26.790 line:80%
-[in Korean] Bye, then.
-Bye.

00:23:30.210 --> 00:23:31.837 line:80%
It seems like something's up.

00:23:34.631 --> 00:23:36.675 line:80%
Ms. Kim Nabong, worry about yourself

00:23:37.217 --> 00:23:39.845 line:80%
until your surgery.

00:23:39.928 --> 00:23:40.929 line:80%
Hmm?

00:23:47.186 --> 00:23:48.228 line:80%
[therapist] Is this okay?

00:23:48.312 --> 00:23:49.396 line:80%
Yes, it's okay.

00:23:49.480 --> 00:23:51.482 line:80%
-Tell me if it hurts.
-Okay.

00:23:52.650 --> 00:23:54.652 line:80%
[therapist]
You're checking with him again.

00:23:54.735 --> 00:23:56.820 line:80%
Of course. I should record this every day.

00:23:56.904 --> 00:23:59.615 line:80%
He has to pass
the medical test in February.

00:23:59.698 --> 00:24:01.533 line:80%
Then let's check your ankle now.

00:24:01.617 --> 00:24:04.036 line:80%
Try pulling with strength.

00:24:04.995 --> 00:24:06.538 line:80%
[therapist inhales sharply]

00:24:06.622 --> 00:24:07.790 line:80%
It doesn't hurt?

00:24:07.873 --> 00:24:09.458 line:80%
No, not at all.

00:24:09.541 --> 00:24:13.087 line:80%
[gasps] Your range of motion
has improved a lot since last week.

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:14.254 line:80%
Right, Doctor?

00:24:14.338 --> 00:24:15.881 line:80%
[therapist] Yes. [chuckles]

00:24:15.964 --> 00:24:18.217 line:80%
Then, next week,
we'll fit you with an ankle brace

00:24:18.300 --> 00:24:19.510 line:80%
and work on standing up.

00:24:19.593 --> 00:24:21.720 line:80%
Don't strain yourself. Good job.

00:24:21.804 --> 00:24:23.180 line:80%
-Thank you.
-Bye.

00:24:24.181 --> 00:24:26.433 line:80%
That was two degrees more than last week.

00:24:26.517 --> 00:24:28.310 line:80%
Are you sure it didn't hurt?

00:24:28.394 --> 00:24:30.521 line:80%
I know my body better than anyone.

00:24:30.604 --> 00:24:34.149 line:80%
I feel like I'll be able to get up soon
and start throwing balls.

00:24:34.233 --> 00:24:35.734 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:24:35.818 --> 00:24:38.988 line:80%
Mr. Cha, you really have
exceptional recovery speed,

00:24:39.071 --> 00:24:40.489 line:80%
-as expected.
-[clears throat]

00:24:40.572 --> 00:24:43.534 line:80%
Then let's start
outdoors practice tomorrow

00:24:43.617 --> 00:24:45.786 line:80%
so you don't lose your touch.

00:24:46.578 --> 00:24:49.081 line:80%
Yes, Coach. Let's do this.

00:24:49.164 --> 00:24:50.165 line:80%
[both chuckle]

00:24:50.249 --> 00:24:51.750 line:80%
-[cell phone vibrating]
-Ah.

00:24:53.669 --> 00:24:54.962 line:80%
-Hang on.
-Sure.

00:24:55.045 --> 00:24:56.296 line:80%
Hello?

00:25:11.812 --> 00:25:12.855 line:80%
Come in.

00:25:15.858 --> 00:25:17.443 line:80%
Are you just going to leave again?

00:25:17.985 --> 00:25:19.278 line:80%
Come in.

00:25:22.406 --> 00:25:23.490 line:80%
Mr. Yeon.

00:25:47.723 --> 00:25:48.891 line:80%
I've failed you again.

00:25:51.352 --> 00:25:53.979 line:80%
I've never protected you properly.

00:25:55.272 --> 00:25:56.565 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:25:58.359 --> 00:25:59.401 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:25:59.485 --> 00:26:00.694 line:80%
So,

00:26:02.863 --> 00:26:05.366 line:80%
were you going to wait until I recovered

00:26:06.367 --> 00:26:07.576 line:80%
and try to quit again?

00:26:08.369 --> 00:26:09.995 line:80%
Like that day, 13 years ago?

00:26:10.079 --> 00:26:12.081 line:80%
[♪ melancholy music playing]

00:26:15.501 --> 00:26:17.836 line:80%
Good job. You can go now.

00:26:18.962 --> 00:26:20.464 line:80%
Ms. Kim…

00:26:20.547 --> 00:26:22.966 line:80%
LETTER OF RESIGNATION

00:26:23.050 --> 00:26:24.343 line:80%
I'm sorry, Ms. Kim.

00:26:25.010 --> 00:26:26.762 line:80%
If only I hadn't been sick that day…

00:26:27.846 --> 00:26:29.348 line:80%
If I'd been the one driving…

00:26:31.517 --> 00:26:33.477 line:80%
I couldn't even repay you
for your kindness.

00:26:33.936 --> 00:26:34.979 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:26:36.772 --> 00:26:39.316 line:80%
If you have time to talk such nonsense,

00:26:39.858 --> 00:26:40.859 line:80%
use that time

00:26:42.528 --> 00:26:43.779 line:80%
to prepare for college.

00:26:45.572 --> 00:26:47.408 line:80%
You'd better get accepted in one try.

00:26:48.575 --> 00:26:49.576 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:26:51.036 --> 00:26:53.330 line:80%
<i>You made that same face</i>

00:26:53.956 --> 00:26:56.000 line:80%
<i>after Hyewon and Junho's funeral.</i>

00:27:00.796 --> 00:27:02.756 line:80%
When I met you for the first time,

00:27:04.299 --> 00:27:06.760 line:80%
do you know why I told you to come see me?

00:27:08.429 --> 00:27:09.888 line:80%
You reminded me of my past.

00:27:11.348 --> 00:27:13.058 line:80%
Even if no one noticed,

00:27:14.476 --> 00:27:16.103 line:80%
I did my best

00:27:17.354 --> 00:27:20.691 line:80%
and worked so hard on my own
in Paris when I was 20.

00:27:23.736 --> 00:27:25.696 line:80%
[♪ sentimental music playing]

00:27:25.779 --> 00:27:27.281 line:80%
As soon as I turned 20,

00:27:27.364 --> 00:27:29.783 line:80%
I flew to Paris alone
with no friends or family.

00:27:29.867 --> 00:27:33.162 line:80%
I threw myself
into both studying and love.

00:27:34.288 --> 00:27:35.998 line:80%
But I suddenly got pregnant

00:27:36.582 --> 00:27:38.417 line:80%
and gave birth by myself.

00:27:38.917 --> 00:27:40.377 line:80%
I struggled so hard

00:27:41.378 --> 00:27:44.089 line:80%
attending fashion school,
carrying a baby on my back.

00:27:48.469 --> 00:27:52.806 line:80%
I told myself that someone
would notice my efforts someday,

00:27:54.224 --> 00:27:55.643 line:80%
and I pushed through.

00:27:56.518 --> 00:27:57.603 line:80%
[sobs]

00:27:57.686 --> 00:27:59.021 line:80%
[Nana] Once I succeeded,

00:28:00.731 --> 00:28:01.815 line:80%
I felt so much pity

00:28:03.400 --> 00:28:04.777 line:80%
and pride

00:28:05.486 --> 00:28:07.071 line:80%
for myself back then.

00:28:11.075 --> 00:28:12.409 line:80%
I saw you that day,

00:28:13.535 --> 00:28:16.205 line:80%
and I felt the same way about you.

00:28:17.539 --> 00:28:19.124 line:80%
That's why I reached out a hand.

00:28:19.208 --> 00:28:22.628 line:80%
Because I wanted to acknowledge
your efforts.

00:28:23.420 --> 00:28:24.421 line:80%
You…

00:28:25.839 --> 00:28:27.174 line:80%
took care of me…

00:28:30.135 --> 00:28:32.012 line:80%
and changed my life, but…

00:28:32.096 --> 00:28:34.014 line:80%
I never thought of it like that,

00:28:35.391 --> 00:28:37.476 line:80%
but you've already repaid me enough.

00:28:37.559 --> 00:28:38.811 line:80%
Without you,

00:28:38.894 --> 00:28:41.730 line:80%
neither I nor my company nor my family

00:28:42.523 --> 00:28:44.692 line:80%
would have gotten this far.

00:28:44.775 --> 00:28:45.859 line:80%
No.

00:28:46.777 --> 00:28:47.778 line:80%
I…

00:28:49.363 --> 00:28:51.115 line:80%
I don't have the right to stay…

00:28:51.198 --> 00:28:52.574 line:80%
Taeseok.

00:28:58.288 --> 00:28:59.581 line:80%
Put down that burden now.

00:29:03.168 --> 00:29:05.170 line:80%
You couldn't have prevented the accident

00:29:06.088 --> 00:29:07.423 line:80%
by driving that day,

00:29:08.590 --> 00:29:10.300 line:80%
nor could you have prevented this

00:29:11.218 --> 00:29:12.636 line:80%
by noticing more quickly.

00:29:13.429 --> 00:29:16.307 line:80%
No one in my family
blames you for what happened.

00:29:16.390 --> 00:29:19.351 line:80%
You've been holding onto that guilt
because you're too kind.

00:29:20.811 --> 00:29:22.354 line:80%
But you don't have to do that.

00:29:22.438 --> 00:29:24.606 line:80%
-[sobbing]
-[Nana] Put it all down now.

00:29:30.654 --> 00:29:32.072 line:80%
You've done a great job so far

00:29:33.073 --> 00:29:34.783 line:80%
working by my side.

00:29:36.493 --> 00:29:39.621 line:80%
So stay with me.

00:29:39.705 --> 00:29:42.499 line:80%
[sobbing]

00:29:49.256 --> 00:29:51.258 line:80%
[Taeseok crying]

00:29:59.642 --> 00:30:00.643 line:20%
[young Hayeong] Mr. Yeon.

00:30:02.061 --> 00:30:03.312 line:80%
[young Taeseok] I'm sorry.

00:30:03.395 --> 00:30:04.688 line:80%
I'm really sorry.

00:30:04.772 --> 00:30:06.106 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:30:06.190 --> 00:30:07.650 line:80%
I'm really sorry.

00:30:09.026 --> 00:30:10.027 line:80%
I…

00:30:11.111 --> 00:30:12.780 line:80%
shouldn't be sick.

00:30:16.742 --> 00:30:18.744 line:80%
[Taeseok crying]

00:30:24.833 --> 00:30:26.835 line:80%
[footsteps approaching]

00:30:26.919 --> 00:30:27.920 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:30:34.385 --> 00:30:37.012 line:80%
Do you want one?

00:30:46.146 --> 00:30:47.231 line:80%
[Hayeong sighs]

00:30:49.942 --> 00:30:51.276 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:30:52.277 --> 00:30:54.029 line:80%
I didn't mean to eavesdrop,

00:30:54.113 --> 00:30:58.492 line:80%
but I brought fruits for Grandma
and ended up overhearing.

00:31:00.911 --> 00:31:04.707 line:80%
Ah. So that's why
you were at Mom and Dad's grave.

00:31:04.790 --> 00:31:06.375 line:80%
Okay. I understand now.

00:31:07.418 --> 00:31:10.004 line:80%
-I'm sorry.
-Stop saying you're sorry.

00:31:10.087 --> 00:31:14.008 line:80%
Like Grandma said,
none of us have ever blamed you.

00:31:14.091 --> 00:31:15.467 line:80%
Not for a single second.

00:31:15.551 --> 00:31:18.012 line:80%
Mom, Dad. It's not his fault, right?

00:31:20.556 --> 00:31:22.766 line:80%
You heard that, right? They said no.

00:31:24.685 --> 00:31:25.686 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:31:28.856 --> 00:31:29.857 line:80%
[Hayeong] Here.

00:31:29.940 --> 00:31:34.320 line:80%
Have this sweet and sour candy
that you love so much…

00:31:39.158 --> 00:31:40.701 line:80%
and leave all your burdens behind.

00:31:42.328 --> 00:31:43.746 line:80%
[chuckles softly]

00:31:44.413 --> 00:31:45.414 line:80%
Have this

00:31:46.457 --> 00:31:47.708 line:80%
and cheer up.

00:31:51.337 --> 00:31:53.255 line:80%
-You're giving this to me again.
-What?

00:31:53.797 --> 00:31:56.008 line:80%
Didn't you give me one last time?

00:31:57.301 --> 00:31:58.385 line:80%
Did I?

00:32:02.181 --> 00:32:04.975 line:80%
[winces] It's so sour. Why is it so sour?

00:32:08.228 --> 00:32:09.438 line:80%
[chuckles]

00:32:09.521 --> 00:32:11.523 line:80%
[♪ heartwarming music playing]

00:32:12.399 --> 00:32:14.985 line:80%
YOU SAVED ME TOO

00:32:18.072 --> 00:32:19.073 line:80%
[Haran sighs]

00:32:19.990 --> 00:32:21.075 line:80%
[Chan stutters]

00:32:21.158 --> 00:32:23.661 line:80%
No exceptions.
Don't let anyone in my office.

00:32:28.540 --> 00:32:29.541 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:32:30.501 --> 00:32:32.336 line:80%
[coughs, sniffles]

00:32:34.755 --> 00:32:37.383 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:32:38.133 --> 00:32:39.843 line:80%
MR. PARK

00:32:43.931 --> 00:32:44.932 line:80%
Yes, Mr. Park.

00:32:45.599 --> 00:32:46.976 line:80%
What's wrong with your voice?

00:32:47.059 --> 00:32:48.268 line:80%
Did you catch a cold?

00:32:48.352 --> 00:32:49.353 line:80%
Oh…

00:32:51.271 --> 00:32:53.941 line:80%
Maybe it's because you're not here.
[chuckles softly]

00:32:54.024 --> 00:32:55.317 line:80%
I have no one to talk to,

00:32:56.527 --> 00:32:59.738 line:80%
so I guess my voice is a bit rusty.
[clears throat]

00:33:00.322 --> 00:33:02.741 line:80%
[inhales sharply] Is…

00:33:03.826 --> 00:33:05.285 line:80%
something the matter?

00:33:05.911 --> 00:33:08.414 line:80%
Besides the fact that I miss you,
everything's fine.

00:33:09.206 --> 00:33:10.958 line:80%
It must be tough at the hospital.

00:33:12.418 --> 00:33:15.045 line:80%
I'm doing well here with Genius,

00:33:16.422 --> 00:33:17.464 line:80%
so don't worry

00:33:18.465 --> 00:33:19.883 line:80%
and take care of yourself, too.

00:33:20.551 --> 00:33:21.635 line:80%
All right.

00:33:23.137 --> 00:33:24.221 line:80%
[cell phone beeps]

00:33:26.390 --> 00:33:29.560 line:80%
[Genius whining]

00:33:32.896 --> 00:33:34.106 line:80%
I'm okay.

00:33:35.399 --> 00:33:38.485 line:80%
No, I'll make sure everything's okay.

00:33:41.655 --> 00:33:43.657 line:80%
Everything will be okay.

00:33:51.582 --> 00:33:52.916 line:80%
Song Haran.

00:33:54.251 --> 00:33:55.252 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:33:55.336 --> 00:33:56.754 line:80%
You saved me,

00:33:57.504 --> 00:33:58.797 line:80%
seven years ago.

00:33:59.465 --> 00:34:01.008 line:80%
You saved me back then!

00:34:07.181 --> 00:34:08.307 line:80%
[Chan panting]

00:34:10.601 --> 00:34:11.602 line:80%
I'm sorry.

00:34:12.311 --> 00:34:14.146 line:80%
Seven years ago and now,

00:34:14.229 --> 00:34:16.565 line:80%
I've wanted to show you the real me.

00:34:18.233 --> 00:34:20.694 line:80%
I should have told you, no matter what.

00:34:22.196 --> 00:34:23.238 line:80%
[Chan sighs]

00:34:25.949 --> 00:34:27.076 line:80%
It's all my fault.

00:34:31.705 --> 00:34:34.583 line:80%
Please, just look at this.
Everything's in here.

00:34:35.709 --> 00:34:38.545 line:80%
Stories that you don't know
about back then.

00:34:42.633 --> 00:34:43.967 line:80%
Let me ask you two things.

00:34:45.719 --> 00:34:47.471 line:80%
Just say yes or no.

00:34:50.933 --> 00:34:52.393 line:80%
If I look at this,

00:34:54.520 --> 00:34:55.938 line:80%
will it change the fact

00:34:58.107 --> 00:35:00.776 line:80%
that you pretended to be Hyeokchan
and messaged me…

00:35:03.904 --> 00:35:04.905 line:80%
seven years ago?

00:35:08.033 --> 00:35:10.202 line:80%
[♪ melancholy music playing]

00:35:10.285 --> 00:35:11.829 line:80%
-No.
-[Haran] Then,

00:35:11.912 --> 00:35:14.373 line:80%
does it change the fact

00:35:16.458 --> 00:35:19.128 line:80%
that you kept this secret from me
the whole time…

00:35:22.172 --> 00:35:23.257 line:80%
while you were with me?

00:35:24.299 --> 00:35:26.468 line:80%
-Haran.
-Say yes or no.

00:35:29.763 --> 00:35:30.764 line:80%
No.

00:35:32.474 --> 00:35:34.476 line:80%
-But--
-Then it won't change my mind.

00:35:36.061 --> 00:35:37.646 line:80%
If those two facts don't change,

00:35:37.730 --> 00:35:39.898 line:80%
then whatever explanation you give

00:35:41.066 --> 00:35:42.151 line:80%
or whatever you do,

00:35:42.901 --> 00:35:44.278 line:80%
it won't change my mind.

00:35:46.905 --> 00:35:50.993 line:80%
If you still think the lies you told
can be explained by something,

00:35:52.619 --> 00:35:54.538 line:80%
then you still have no clue

00:35:56.832 --> 00:35:58.709 line:80%
how you've shattered my heart

00:36:00.544 --> 00:36:04.340 line:80%
and how you've destroyed
the past seven years of my life.

00:36:06.800 --> 00:36:08.635 line:80%
Don't ever show up in front of me again.

00:36:10.387 --> 00:36:11.597 line:80%
When I see you,

00:36:13.140 --> 00:36:17.061 line:80%
I feel like I'm going to lose my mind
thinking about the seven years I lost.

00:36:21.106 --> 00:36:22.941 line:80%
[Chan] I won't even
think about staying with you.

00:36:23.025 --> 00:36:25.986 line:80%
But you'll go back
to how you were seven years ago…

00:36:26.862 --> 00:36:27.946 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:36:32.284 --> 00:36:34.578 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:36:34.662 --> 00:36:35.746 line:80%
[groans]

00:36:37.706 --> 00:36:39.500 line:80%
[groaning]

00:36:40.834 --> 00:36:41.835 line:80%
[grunts]

00:36:41.919 --> 00:36:43.921 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:37:01.897 --> 00:37:03.315 line:80%
[♪ music swells]

00:37:25.170 --> 00:37:26.630 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:37:26.714 --> 00:37:29.508 line:80%
-[exclaims] Cha Yougyum!
-[clears throat]

00:37:29.591 --> 00:37:31.468 line:80%
Your pitching is still amazing.

00:37:31.552 --> 00:37:36.223 line:80%
No wonder you were always named MVP
at every tournament.

00:37:36.307 --> 00:37:37.391 line:80%
[Hadam chuckles]

00:37:39.560 --> 00:37:40.561 line:80%
[inhales sharply]

00:37:41.562 --> 00:37:42.563 line:80%
[grunts]

00:37:43.522 --> 00:37:45.357 line:80%
Oh, gosh, I missed it.

00:37:47.735 --> 00:37:48.986 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:37:50.779 --> 00:37:52.114 line:80%
Hadam, let's stop.

00:37:52.197 --> 00:37:53.407 line:80%
You must be tired.

00:37:53.490 --> 00:37:55.534 line:80%
I'll ask Changmo to help me later.

00:37:55.617 --> 00:37:57.494 line:80%
No. We can do it.

00:37:57.578 --> 00:37:58.871 line:80%
Let's go.

00:38:00.456 --> 00:38:02.124 line:80%
All right, throw it.

00:38:07.796 --> 00:38:09.131 line:80%
[grunts]

00:38:09.214 --> 00:38:12.176 line:80%
Gosh, I missed it again. I'll go get it.

00:38:19.683 --> 00:38:20.684 line:80%
[sighs]

00:38:22.853 --> 00:38:24.021 line:80%
[sighs worriedly]

00:38:27.941 --> 00:38:29.151 line:80%
Did we overdo it?

00:38:29.902 --> 00:38:30.903 line:80%
You must be tired.

00:38:31.654 --> 00:38:32.696 line:80%
Not at all.

00:38:32.780 --> 00:38:34.281 line:80%
I know my body best.

00:38:34.365 --> 00:38:36.408 line:80%
[inhales sharply] I feel much lighter now.

00:38:38.160 --> 00:38:39.161 line:80%
Oh, right.

00:38:40.412 --> 00:38:44.083 line:80%
My team's visiting later,
so it's going to be really noisy.

00:38:44.166 --> 00:38:45.376 line:80%
You should head home now.

00:38:45.459 --> 00:38:48.170 line:80%
Then I should go and study rehabilitation.

00:38:49.213 --> 00:38:51.382 line:80%
Have fun with the guys.
I'll call you later.

00:38:51.465 --> 00:38:52.549 line:80%
Okay.

00:38:54.677 --> 00:38:56.303 line:80%
[sighs dreamily]

00:38:56.887 --> 00:38:58.305 line:80%
Those punks.

00:38:58.389 --> 00:39:01.100 line:80%
I should give them some snacks.

00:39:01.934 --> 00:39:04.228 line:80%
Hmm? It's pretty quiet, though.

00:39:07.815 --> 00:39:09.316 line:80%
[Yougyum sobbing]

00:39:11.402 --> 00:39:13.362 line:80%
[♪ emotional music playing]

00:39:13.445 --> 00:39:14.780 line:80%
[umpire] <i>Out!</i>

00:39:14.863 --> 00:39:16.198 line:20%
[players cheering]

00:39:16.281 --> 00:39:18.033 line:20%
FINAL, CHEONGSOL HIGH 3
HANEUL HIGH 2

00:39:19.326 --> 00:39:20.327 line:80%
[sniffles]

00:39:26.041 --> 00:39:27.751 line:80%
[sniffles]

00:39:28.669 --> 00:39:30.129 line:80%
[stutters] Yougyum.

00:39:32.506 --> 00:39:33.507 line:80%
[Yougyum] Hadam…

00:39:35.134 --> 00:39:36.260 line:80%
What do I do?

00:39:39.179 --> 00:39:40.723 line:80%
[breathes shakily]

00:39:42.266 --> 00:39:43.267 line:80%
I…

00:39:43.809 --> 00:39:45.602 line:80%
I don't think I can make it.

00:39:47.646 --> 00:39:50.649 line:80%
I know my body better than anyone.

00:39:52.026 --> 00:39:54.028 line:80%
[Yougyum crying]

00:40:07.458 --> 00:40:10.127 line:80%
CHEONGSOL HIGH SCHOOL WINS

00:40:16.216 --> 00:40:17.217 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:40:22.264 --> 00:40:23.349 line:80%
What is it?

00:40:24.350 --> 00:40:25.351 line:80%
Can't you sleep?

00:40:25.809 --> 00:40:27.186 line:80%
Should I turn the light off?

00:40:27.269 --> 00:40:28.270 line:80%
No.

00:40:28.354 --> 00:40:29.355 line:80%
Manjae,

00:40:30.189 --> 00:40:31.315 line:80%
you should go home.

00:40:32.149 --> 00:40:33.525 line:80%
Go and sleep comfortably.

00:40:35.235 --> 00:40:36.904 line:80%
[Manjae] I'll go once you're asleep.

00:40:37.446 --> 00:40:38.947 line:80%
But why can't you sleep?

00:40:42.076 --> 00:40:43.077 line:80%
I just…

00:40:44.453 --> 00:40:46.288 line:80%
have a lot on my mind.

00:40:47.164 --> 00:40:48.165 line:80%
Goodness.

00:40:48.666 --> 00:40:49.875 line:80%
It's snowing.

00:40:51.251 --> 00:40:53.170 line:80%
[Manjae] Oh. It is.

00:40:59.802 --> 00:41:02.554 line:80%
Why do you have a lot on your mind?

00:41:03.389 --> 00:41:07.643 line:80%
You know I've been tough
since I was little, right?

00:41:08.978 --> 00:41:09.979 line:80%
But…

00:41:11.397 --> 00:41:14.441 line:80%
thinking about going under anesthesia
and getting surgery

00:41:16.276 --> 00:41:17.569 line:80%
makes me feel a bit nervous.

00:41:22.908 --> 00:41:25.744 line:80%
I'm sure the surgery will go well.

00:41:26.578 --> 00:41:29.707 line:80%
Just be yourself, the strong Kim Nana,

00:41:30.833 --> 00:41:31.959 line:80%
and get through this.

00:41:32.710 --> 00:41:36.880 line:80%
I'm more worried about something else
than drilling a hole in my skull.

00:41:37.631 --> 00:41:38.632 line:80%
What is it?

00:41:40.009 --> 00:41:41.760 line:80%
I have to shave my head here.

00:41:42.594 --> 00:41:44.805 line:80%
That would ruin my look.

00:41:45.306 --> 00:41:46.890 line:80%
Why does that worry me more?

00:41:47.016 --> 00:41:49.310 line:80%
[laughs]

00:41:49.393 --> 00:41:52.021 line:80%
You really are the Chuncheon fashionista.

00:41:52.104 --> 00:41:53.355 line:80%
[laughs]

00:41:55.357 --> 00:41:56.358 line:80%
This won't do.

00:41:57.067 --> 00:42:00.195 line:80%
I should protect your look.

00:42:01.071 --> 00:42:02.323 line:80%
Hang on.

00:42:02.406 --> 00:42:03.532 line:80%
What?

00:42:06.243 --> 00:42:07.244 line:80%
Oh, my.

00:42:08.370 --> 00:42:10.247 line:80%
This is hand-knitted.

00:42:11.290 --> 00:42:12.666 line:80%
Did you really…

00:42:14.126 --> 00:42:16.128 line:80%
[♪ lighthearted music playing]

00:42:18.213 --> 00:42:21.967 line:80%
[Manjae] <i>I knitted it in secret</i>
<i>while you were sleeping.</i>

00:42:23.635 --> 00:42:27.014 line:80%
<i>But I think I'm a knitting genius.</i>

00:42:28.098 --> 00:42:30.434 line:80%
-I followed along easily.
-[gasps]

00:42:30.517 --> 00:42:31.894 line:80%
I might have to open

00:42:32.519 --> 00:42:35.272 line:80%
a knitting workshop in my coffee shop.

00:42:35.356 --> 00:42:36.523 line:80%
-Huh?
-[chuckles]

00:42:36.607 --> 00:42:37.983 line:80%
How did you…

00:42:38.067 --> 00:42:41.028 line:80%
Would you like to try it on?

00:42:46.533 --> 00:42:47.534 line:80%
Wow.

00:42:49.745 --> 00:42:50.954 line:80%
You look beautiful.

00:42:51.038 --> 00:42:52.164 line:80%
-Really?
-Yes.

00:42:52.247 --> 00:42:53.374 line:80%
-Let me see.
-Okay.

00:42:55.584 --> 00:42:56.752 line:80%
Here, look.

00:42:57.461 --> 00:42:59.004 line:80%
[gasps, giggles]

00:43:02.299 --> 00:43:03.884 line:80%
-[chuckles]
-Nabong.

00:43:04.635 --> 00:43:06.387 line:80%
After the surgery,

00:43:08.889 --> 00:43:10.057 line:80%
why don't you rest

00:43:11.266 --> 00:43:12.267 line:80%
by my side?

00:43:13.644 --> 00:43:14.645 line:80%
What?

00:43:14.728 --> 00:43:16.021 line:80%
[Manjae] Kim Nabong.

00:43:17.147 --> 00:43:19.817 line:80%
It took a long time,

00:43:20.943 --> 00:43:22.444 line:80%
but will you begin

00:43:23.112 --> 00:43:25.572 line:80%
your second "La Vie en Rose"

00:43:26.407 --> 00:43:28.450 line:80%
with me, Park Manjae?

00:43:36.000 --> 00:43:37.209 line:80%
Hmm?

00:43:38.252 --> 00:43:39.253 line:80%
Manjae.

00:44:02.901 --> 00:44:05.571 line:80%
You've been through so much all this time.

00:44:07.448 --> 00:44:08.824 line:80%
So get some rest

00:44:10.284 --> 00:44:11.285 line:80%
by my side now.

00:44:23.130 --> 00:44:24.131 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

00:44:25.716 --> 00:44:26.842 line:80%
Hey, roomie.

00:44:27.801 --> 00:44:29.720 line:80%
Why are you sitting there in the dark?

00:44:36.977 --> 00:44:37.978 line:80%
Hey.

00:44:38.646 --> 00:44:39.813 line:80%
Is something wrong?

00:44:41.815 --> 00:44:42.858 line:80%
She…

00:44:44.151 --> 00:44:45.694 line:80%
found out about everything.

00:44:46.528 --> 00:44:48.364 line:80%
I didn't have the chance to explain.

00:44:54.578 --> 00:44:56.205 line:80%
It's all my fault,

00:44:57.247 --> 00:45:00.709 line:80%
but she's the one suffering
when she did nothing wrong.

00:45:01.877 --> 00:45:03.754 line:80%
It hurts so much

00:45:06.882 --> 00:45:08.467 line:80%
to see her in pain…

00:45:10.260 --> 00:45:12.805 line:80%
[scoffs] But I must be crazy.

00:45:14.807 --> 00:45:16.225 line:80%
Despite everything,

00:45:19.728 --> 00:45:20.729 line:80%
I still

00:45:22.439 --> 00:45:24.316 line:80%
want to see her so badly.

00:45:26.110 --> 00:45:27.611 line:80%
[Manjae sighs]

00:45:29.196 --> 00:45:31.031 line:80%
If I lose her like this,

00:45:33.409 --> 00:45:34.702 line:80%
if I…

00:45:36.704 --> 00:45:38.664 line:80%
make her return to her old self,

00:45:39.915 --> 00:45:40.916 line:80%
then…

00:45:42.042 --> 00:45:43.627 line:80%
[sighs dejectedly] Then…

00:45:45.337 --> 00:45:46.880 line:80%
Oh, dear…

00:45:48.424 --> 00:45:52.219 line:80%
I did wonder if something was wrong. Gosh.

00:45:52.302 --> 00:45:53.387 line:80%
[mumbles]

00:45:54.680 --> 00:45:55.681 line:80%
[exclaims softly]

00:45:55.764 --> 00:45:56.765 line:80%
You're burning up.

00:45:56.849 --> 00:45:58.392 line:80%
How long have you been like this?

00:45:58.892 --> 00:46:00.894 line:80%
-Huh? Oh?
-[Chan sighs]

00:46:00.978 --> 00:46:03.605 line:80%
[exclaims worriedly] Hey! Roomie!

00:46:03.689 --> 00:46:04.732 line:80%
Hey!

00:46:04.815 --> 00:46:05.899 line:80%
Chan!

00:46:09.069 --> 00:46:10.487 line:80%
Goodness.

00:46:17.077 --> 00:46:20.664 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I want to stay by her side</i>

00:46:21.498 --> 00:46:23.834 line:80%
in spring, in summer,

00:46:23.917 --> 00:46:25.544 line:80%
in fall, and in winter.

00:46:26.295 --> 00:46:27.296 line:80%
I want

00:46:27.379 --> 00:46:29.757 line:80%
to stay by her side,

00:46:29.840 --> 00:46:31.717 line:80%
but I don't know what to do.

00:46:31.800 --> 00:46:33.093 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

00:46:33.177 --> 00:46:36.096 line:80%
Do you need someone to talk to?

00:46:37.056 --> 00:46:38.390 line:80%
Ah…

00:46:38.474 --> 00:46:40.142 line:80%
I made some assumptions,

00:46:40.809 --> 00:46:43.979 line:80%
but there was a lot more I didn't know.

00:46:45.314 --> 00:46:48.108 line:80%
You must have had
such a hard time until now.

00:46:48.942 --> 00:46:50.361 line:80%
You've been through a lot.

00:46:51.362 --> 00:46:54.156 line:80%
I want to tell her everything
and stay by her side,

00:46:54.865 --> 00:46:56.659 line:80%
but if I tell her about myself,

00:46:59.078 --> 00:47:00.329 line:80%
it will hurt her.

00:47:01.538 --> 00:47:03.415 line:80%
I'm not even sure

00:47:03.499 --> 00:47:06.085 line:80%
if I can explain myself to her
without reopening

00:47:06.669 --> 00:47:07.711 line:80%
[sighs]

00:47:08.337 --> 00:47:09.463 line:80%
her old wounds.

00:47:10.297 --> 00:47:12.091 line:80%
But if you're this sincere,

00:47:12.675 --> 00:47:15.678 line:80%
don't you think
she'll realize it in the end?

00:47:16.637 --> 00:47:19.098 line:80%
To be honest, I'm scared.

00:47:20.432 --> 00:47:22.351 line:80%
If I act rashly,

00:47:22.434 --> 00:47:25.479 line:80%
my flawed memories might ruin everything.

00:47:26.063 --> 00:47:27.064 line:80%
I'm scared…

00:47:30.484 --> 00:47:32.027 line:80%
I'll hurt her again.

00:47:32.569 --> 00:47:33.612 line:80%
Chan.

00:47:34.905 --> 00:47:36.615 line:80%
After living all these years,

00:47:37.074 --> 00:47:39.952 line:80%
what I've learned is that
waiting until everything's perfect

00:47:40.035 --> 00:47:41.829 line:80%
isn't always the answer.

00:47:42.579 --> 00:47:44.999 line:80%
For people and for love.

00:47:45.833 --> 00:47:47.084 line:80%
[in Latin] <i>"Memento Mori."</i>

00:47:47.584 --> 00:47:49.128 line:80%
[in Korean] You said
you don't want regrets.

00:47:49.712 --> 00:47:50.838 line:80%
If you keep waiting,

00:47:50.921 --> 00:47:53.007 line:80%
you might lose your chance
and regret it later.

00:47:53.090 --> 00:47:56.427 line:80%
Why don't you show her
how sincere you are first?

00:47:57.344 --> 00:48:00.389 line:80%
It won't be too late
to take care of other things later.

00:48:02.141 --> 00:48:03.559 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:48:08.981 --> 00:48:12.735 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I should get ready</i>
<i>to explain myself to her.</i>

00:48:15.154 --> 00:48:16.363 line:80%
<i>I should start</i>

00:48:16.947 --> 00:48:18.866 line:80%
<i>by what happened seven years ago</i>

00:48:21.577 --> 00:48:23.162 line:80%
<i>and tell her in my own way.</i>

00:48:27.416 --> 00:48:28.417 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:48:28.500 --> 00:48:30.252 line:80%
[shudders] It's so cold.

00:48:30.336 --> 00:48:33.422 line:80%
Why are you brooding out here in the cold?

00:48:33.505 --> 00:48:34.965 line:80%
What time is it?

00:48:35.049 --> 00:48:36.383 line:80%
[Hayeong] It's past midnight.

00:48:36.467 --> 00:48:38.761 line:80%
How long have you been here?
You're already unwell.

00:48:38.844 --> 00:48:39.845 line:80%
Come inside.

00:48:40.804 --> 00:48:43.015 line:80%
Oh, uh… Did you go to the hospital?

00:48:45.017 --> 00:48:46.977 line:80%
Haran, what is it?

00:48:47.728 --> 00:48:49.647 line:80%
Huh? Is something wrong?

00:48:50.314 --> 00:48:51.607 line:80%
What's going on?

00:48:52.191 --> 00:48:53.942 line:80%
-Hayeong.
-Yes?

00:48:55.444 --> 00:48:56.779 line:80%
I want to wake up.

00:48:59.531 --> 00:49:02.076 line:80%
I thought I was in a dream until now,

00:49:03.452 --> 00:49:05.037 line:80%
but I guess it was a nightmare.

00:49:06.413 --> 00:49:07.748 line:80%
[♪ somber music playing]

00:49:07.831 --> 00:49:09.708 line:80%
I want to wake up,

00:49:10.918 --> 00:49:12.628 line:80%
but I don't know how.

00:49:14.588 --> 00:49:18.092 line:80%
-Haran.
-We're not meant to be together.

00:49:20.427 --> 00:49:23.806 line:80%
I have to forget things
that seem impossible to forget.

00:49:26.892 --> 00:49:28.268 line:80%
But I don't know

00:49:29.895 --> 00:49:31.981 line:80%
how to get over everything.

00:49:34.400 --> 00:49:35.401 line:80%
[Hayeong sighs softly]

00:49:39.029 --> 00:49:40.322 line:80%
[sighs]

00:49:46.036 --> 00:49:47.955 line:80%
-[ice cubes clacking]
-[Hayeong sighs]

00:49:49.164 --> 00:49:50.374 line:80%
[Hayeong grunts softly]

00:49:53.961 --> 00:49:54.962 line:80%
[thermometer beeps]

00:49:56.505 --> 00:49:59.091 line:80%
[sighs in relief] Her fever dropped.

00:50:01.510 --> 00:50:03.012 line:80%
Gosh…

00:50:08.434 --> 00:50:09.435 line:80%
[grunts softly]

00:50:10.811 --> 00:50:11.812 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:50:11.895 --> 00:50:12.938 line:80%
What?

00:50:14.481 --> 00:50:16.525 line:80%
Gosh. What time is it?

00:50:16.608 --> 00:50:18.736 line:80%
0202
NOV 29 SAT

00:50:19.445 --> 00:50:20.571 line:80%
Are you here?

00:50:21.697 --> 00:50:22.698 line:80%
What?

00:50:23.907 --> 00:50:25.075 line:80%
Where did she go?

00:50:26.702 --> 00:50:27.745 line:80%
Haran!

00:50:29.663 --> 00:50:31.749 line:80%
-[sighs wearily]
-[line connects, ringing]

00:50:31.832 --> 00:50:33.917 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:50:35.252 --> 00:50:37.087 line:80%
HAYEONG

00:50:38.839 --> 00:50:40.632 line:80%
[panting] What?

00:50:42.676 --> 00:50:44.219 line:80%
Where did she go?

00:50:50.559 --> 00:50:51.560 line:80%
[cell phone vibrating]

00:50:51.644 --> 00:50:52.895 line:80%
DESIGNER SONG HAYEONG

00:50:53.479 --> 00:50:55.481 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:50:55.981 --> 00:50:56.982 line:80%
[grunts]

00:50:57.608 --> 00:50:59.610 line:80%
[cell phone continues vibrating]

00:51:01.737 --> 00:51:03.072 line:80%
[groans softly]

00:51:03.781 --> 00:51:04.907 line:80%
[sighing]

00:51:11.872 --> 00:51:13.749 line:80%
[groans softly] Hey, Hayeong.

00:51:13.832 --> 00:51:16.710 line:80%
Chan, sorry to call you so late.

00:51:17.419 --> 00:51:19.129 line:80%
But did Haran contact you?

00:51:20.881 --> 00:51:23.676 line:80%
[grunts] Why? What's wrong?

00:51:23.759 --> 00:51:26.011 line:80%
Haran's gone.

00:51:26.095 --> 00:51:28.973 line:80%
The car's gone,
but she's not at the office either.

00:51:29.056 --> 00:51:32.893 line:80%
You're the only one
I could ask where she could be.

00:51:34.019 --> 00:51:36.772 line:80%
<i>I feel so anxious after what she said.</i>

00:51:36.855 --> 00:51:40.985 line:80%
<i>She said she was in a dream,</i>
<i>but it was a nightmare.</i>

00:51:41.694 --> 00:51:42.695 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:51:44.363 --> 00:51:45.823 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:51:45.906 --> 00:51:48.033 line:80%
-I think I know where she is.
-[Manjae exclaims worriedly]

00:51:48.117 --> 00:51:50.077 line:80%
Where are you going?
You're still burning up.

00:51:50.160 --> 00:51:51.996 line:80%
I have to go find her.

00:51:52.871 --> 00:51:53.872 line:80%
It has to be me.

00:51:53.956 --> 00:51:56.875 line:80%
[stutters] What are you saying?
Did something happen to Haran?

00:51:57.960 --> 00:51:59.545 line:80%
Huh? Chan!

00:52:00.004 --> 00:52:01.422 line:80%
[♪ music continues]

00:52:05.843 --> 00:52:07.803 line:80%
[Hayeong] <i>She said</i>
<i>you're not meant to be together</i>

00:52:08.512 --> 00:52:10.139 line:80%
<i>and that she has to forget it.</i>

00:52:10.222 --> 00:52:13.017 line:80%
<i>I couldn't understand what she was saying,</i>

00:52:13.600 --> 00:52:15.769 line:80%
<i>but she's really sick right now.</i>

00:52:16.895 --> 00:52:18.522 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I feel like I'm in a dream.</i>

00:52:18.605 --> 00:52:21.650 line:80%
[Haran] <i>Those words sounded a bit sad.</i>

00:52:22.192 --> 00:52:25.321 line:80%
<i>It sounds like</i>
<i>they're not meant to be together.</i>

00:52:25.946 --> 00:52:28.157 line:80%
-[engine revving]
-[navigator beeping]

00:52:28.240 --> 00:52:30.242 line:80%
[breathing shakily]

00:52:41.503 --> 00:52:44.923 line:80%
[Haran] I said I won't ever forget

00:52:45.007 --> 00:52:47.051 line:80%
this moment.

00:52:47.134 --> 00:52:49.720 line:80%
Ah, and in spring…

00:52:49.803 --> 00:52:52.431 line:80%
[Chan] <i>Let's go see</i>
<i>the cherry blossoms in spring.</i>

00:52:52.514 --> 00:52:54.642 line:80%
We'll have shaved ice in summer…

00:52:55.392 --> 00:52:57.686 line:80%
Oh, and go to the beach.

00:52:58.604 --> 00:53:00.439 line:80%
<i>We'll see the autumn leaves in fall,</i>

00:53:00.939 --> 00:53:03.817 line:80%
<i>and in winter,</i>
<i>it would be fun to go snowboarding.</i>

00:53:07.821 --> 00:53:08.822 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:53:08.906 --> 00:53:10.699 line:80%
-[engine revving]
-[navigator beeping]

00:53:14.536 --> 00:53:15.621 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:53:15.704 --> 00:53:17.623 line:80%
[♪ foreboding music playing]

00:53:19.083 --> 00:53:20.084 line:80%
[grunts]

00:53:20.167 --> 00:53:23.253 line:80%
-[high-pitched ringing]
-[grunts]

00:53:23.337 --> 00:53:24.838 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] <i>Do you have any idea</i>
<i>what you've done?</i>

00:53:24.922 --> 00:53:26.924 line:80%
-[Sujin] <i>You must've jumped at the chance.</i>
-[Haran] <i>I love you, Chan.</i>

00:53:27.007 --> 00:53:28.342 line:80%
<i>Kang Hyeokchan.</i>

00:53:28.425 --> 00:53:29.760 line:80%
<i>Did you have fun…</i>

00:53:30.761 --> 00:53:33.097 line:80%
[grunts, exhales heavily]

00:53:35.015 --> 00:53:37.059 line:80%
[high-pitched ringing]

00:53:44.942 --> 00:53:45.943 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:53:46.360 --> 00:53:48.195 line:80%
[tires screech]

00:53:49.279 --> 00:53:51.281 line:80%
[Chan breathing heavily]

00:53:52.658 --> 00:53:54.660 line:80%
[♪ pensive music playing]

00:54:13.846 --> 00:54:17.474 line:80%
HADONGDO-GIL

00:54:17.558 --> 00:54:19.560 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

00:54:21.895 --> 00:54:22.980 line:80%
<i>No…</i>

00:54:24.231 --> 00:54:25.232 line:80%
<i>No…</i>

00:54:25.733 --> 00:54:27.026 line:80%
<i>Please…</i>

00:54:27.109 --> 00:54:29.403 line:80%
[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:54:29.486 --> 00:54:30.654 line:80%
<i>It can't be…</i>

00:54:31.238 --> 00:54:32.614 line:80%
<i>No way…</i>

00:54:32.698 --> 00:54:33.699 line:80%
<i>Please…</i>

00:54:35.117 --> 00:54:36.702 line:80%
<i>There is no way I caused it.</i>

00:54:42.249 --> 00:54:43.751 line:80%
[Haran crying]

00:54:52.176 --> 00:54:53.635 line:80%
[Chan] <i>But what if I did?</i>

00:54:55.012 --> 00:54:56.096 line:80%
<i>Then she…</i>

00:54:56.180 --> 00:54:57.598 line:80%
[♪ music swells]

00:54:59.141 --> 00:55:01.143 line:80%
[Haran bawling]

00:55:02.895 --> 00:55:04.897 line:80%
[inaudible]

00:55:24.792 --> 00:55:27.211 line:80%
-[♪ music fades]
-[PA beeps]

00:55:27.878 --> 00:55:29.880 line:80%
[indistinct announcement on PA]

00:55:40.724 --> 00:55:42.017 line:80%
[sighs]

00:55:43.811 --> 00:55:44.895 line:80%
I wanted…

00:55:48.107 --> 00:55:49.817 line:80%
to check something for the last time.

00:55:51.151 --> 00:55:52.695 line:80%
Seven years ago…

00:55:52.778 --> 00:55:54.238 line:80%
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

00:55:54.321 --> 00:55:55.572 line:80%
…on the day of the accident.

00:55:57.449 --> 00:55:58.492 line:80%
Did I…

00:56:00.577 --> 00:56:01.912 line:80%
hit Kang Hyeokchan?

00:56:03.580 --> 00:56:06.792 line:80%
Did I hit him and make him fall down?

00:56:08.168 --> 00:56:09.378 line:80%
Is that why his lip tore

00:56:09.920 --> 00:56:11.630 line:80%
and the waste container fell down?

00:56:15.968 --> 00:56:17.052 line:80%
Is that true?

00:56:17.928 --> 00:56:18.929 line:80%
Yes.

00:56:21.348 --> 00:56:22.933 line:80%
You hit Hyeokchan.

00:56:26.562 --> 00:56:28.647 line:80%
But why?

00:56:28.731 --> 00:56:29.732 line:80%
[Sujin] Don't you remember?

00:56:29.815 --> 00:56:33.902 line:80%
The day he came back from his trip,
you told Hyeokchan everything.

00:56:35.946 --> 00:56:36.947 line:80%
[door closes]

00:56:39.241 --> 00:56:40.242 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

00:56:40.326 --> 00:56:41.702 line:80%
Long time no see.

00:56:42.286 --> 00:56:44.038 line:80%
-Right.
-Hang on.

00:56:47.416 --> 00:56:51.128 line:80%
[sighs] Sorry about this.
We need to switch laptops back.

00:56:51.211 --> 00:56:53.213 line:80%
Move all your data from my laptop.

00:56:54.089 --> 00:56:55.090 line:80%
Oh…

00:56:55.174 --> 00:56:56.175 line:80%
Well…

00:56:57.134 --> 00:56:58.218 line:80%
I…

00:56:58.302 --> 00:56:59.845 line:80%
I have something to tell you.

00:57:00.971 --> 00:57:03.307 line:80%
You do? What is it?

00:57:03.891 --> 00:57:05.142 line:20%
[Chan] Uh…

00:57:07.811 --> 00:57:09.647 line:80%
While you were away, I--

00:57:09.730 --> 00:57:11.523 line:80%
Will this take long?

00:57:12.775 --> 00:57:14.151 line:80%
Yes, a bit.

00:57:14.234 --> 00:57:15.694 line:80%
Then let's talk later.

00:57:15.778 --> 00:57:17.696 line:80%
I have to meet my professor right now.

00:57:18.238 --> 00:57:19.823 line:80%
I'll see you, uh…

00:57:20.658 --> 00:57:22.159 line:80%
in the lab later.

00:57:27.748 --> 00:57:28.749 line:80%
[sighs softly]

00:57:29.124 --> 00:57:30.668 line:80%
Right. What is it?

00:57:31.251 --> 00:57:32.753 line:80%
You needed to tell me something.

00:57:32.836 --> 00:57:34.004 line:80%
Your messenger…

00:57:34.755 --> 00:57:35.923 line:80%
What?

00:57:37.049 --> 00:57:38.926 line:80%
While I was using your laptop,

00:57:39.802 --> 00:57:42.930 line:80%
I kept chatting with your girlfriend.

00:57:47.601 --> 00:57:48.727 line:80%
What?

00:57:48.811 --> 00:57:50.479 line:80%
[♪ tense music playing]

00:57:50.562 --> 00:57:53.190 line:80%
What are you talking about?
Say that again.

00:57:53.273 --> 00:57:54.733 line:80%
We ended up

00:57:55.776 --> 00:57:57.152 line:80%
chatting after that.

00:57:58.320 --> 00:58:00.823 line:80%
But she thinks it was you.

00:58:02.533 --> 00:58:05.369 line:80%
[chuckling] Hyeokchan,
you left your earphones in my car…

00:58:05.953 --> 00:58:06.996 line:80%
[Hyeokchan] Are you saying

00:58:07.579 --> 00:58:10.165 line:80%
you've been talking to Haran

00:58:11.041 --> 00:58:12.292 line:80%
while I was away?

00:58:12.751 --> 00:58:13.752 line:80%
Pretending to be me?

00:58:18.841 --> 00:58:20.467 line:80%
Sorry. It's all my fault.

00:58:21.385 --> 00:58:22.386 line:80%
[sighs]

00:58:23.887 --> 00:58:24.888 line:80%
Hang on. [sighs]

00:58:26.557 --> 00:58:27.808 line:80%
Who are you to do that?

00:58:28.684 --> 00:58:32.479 line:80%
Why would you ruin everything like this?

00:58:33.063 --> 00:58:36.483 line:80%
Tell me. What sort of things
have you been saying?

00:58:37.067 --> 00:58:38.068 line:80%
Why?

00:58:38.152 --> 00:58:40.696 line:80%
Did you think it was okay
since I asked you a few times?

00:58:40.779 --> 00:58:43.198 line:80%
You were someone nobody even cared about.

00:58:44.533 --> 00:58:47.953 line:80%
Did you get excited
that someone paid attention to you?

00:58:48.037 --> 00:58:49.621 line:80%
[Chan grunts]

00:58:49.705 --> 00:58:51.665 line:80%
-Kang Hyeokchan!
-[groans softly]

00:58:51.749 --> 00:58:55.669 line:80%
[Sujin] <i>You had your eye</i>
<i>on Hyeokchan's girlfriend, Song Haran.</i>

00:58:56.628 --> 00:58:57.963 line:80%
You told him

00:58:58.505 --> 00:59:01.633 line:80%
that you'd been chatting with her
while he was traveling,

00:59:01.717 --> 00:59:03.218 line:80%
so things got heated.

00:59:03.927 --> 00:59:05.512 line:80%
And you ended up hitting him.

00:59:05.596 --> 00:59:06.930 line:80%
[breath trembling]

00:59:08.265 --> 00:59:11.435 line:80%
Can you still say
you didn't have feelings for her then?

00:59:11.518 --> 00:59:13.520 line:80%
[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:59:14.188 --> 00:59:15.230 line:80%
Then…

00:59:17.107 --> 00:59:19.693 line:80%
[breath trembling] that accident…

00:59:20.819 --> 00:59:23.030 line:80%
Was it because of the container that fell?

00:59:23.113 --> 00:59:25.115 line:80%
[Sujin] Yes. So how do you feel?

00:59:25.699 --> 00:59:28.160 line:80%
Does it feel good to know the truth?

00:59:30.412 --> 00:59:31.664 line:80%
I told you,

00:59:31.747 --> 00:59:34.166 line:80%
nothing good would come
from digging up the past.

00:59:38.879 --> 00:59:41.548 line:80%
It was all because of you.

00:59:42.633 --> 00:59:44.051 line:80%
You caused the accident,

00:59:44.134 --> 00:59:47.096 line:80%
and it killed Hyeokchan
and hurt a lot of people.

00:59:53.936 --> 00:59:56.021 line:80%
<i>Don't act like it's some grand love story.</i>

00:59:56.105 --> 00:59:59.358 line:80%
<i>You just tried to steal</i>
<i>Hyeokchan's girlfriend</i>

00:59:59.441 --> 01:00:01.902 line:80%
<i>and caused the accident that killed him.</i>

01:00:01.986 --> 01:00:03.404 line:80%
<i>That's all you are.</i>

01:00:03.487 --> 01:00:04.905 line:80%
[♪ music swells]

01:00:07.116 --> 01:00:08.951 line:80%
Do you have any idea what you've done?

01:00:09.368 --> 01:00:11.036 line:80%
I'm sorry. It's all my fault.

01:00:14.623 --> 01:00:17.876 line:80%
<i>It was all my fault.</i>

01:00:24.717 --> 01:00:26.260 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

01:00:26.343 --> 01:00:29.221 line:80%
Where in the world did you go?
You even left your phone behind.

01:00:29.304 --> 01:00:31.682 line:80%
You think I wouldn't worry
if you disappeared like that?

01:00:33.851 --> 01:00:35.060 line:80%
[Hayeong clicks tongue]

01:00:36.520 --> 01:00:37.646 line:80%
I was so worried.

01:00:37.730 --> 01:00:39.898 line:80%
You'd better not do that again.

01:00:39.982 --> 01:00:41.775 line:80%
I'm sorry for making you worry.

01:00:43.527 --> 01:00:45.738 line:80%
Ah. What about Chan?

01:00:46.780 --> 01:00:48.741 line:80%
Don't even mention him to me anymore.

01:00:48.824 --> 01:00:51.702 line:80%
I mean, didn't you meet him?

01:00:52.328 --> 01:00:55.873 line:80%
He heard you were gone
and started his car right away.

01:00:55.956 --> 01:00:57.916 line:80%
-Didn't you see him?
-What do you mean?

01:00:58.000 --> 01:01:02.212 line:80%
I called him late last night
because I didn't know where you were.

01:01:02.296 --> 01:01:04.173 line:80%
-I thought he might know.
-[sighs]

01:01:04.256 --> 01:01:07.760 line:80%
He said he knew where you could be
and left right away.

01:01:08.344 --> 01:01:09.636 line:80%
Maybe you missed each other.

01:01:09.720 --> 01:01:11.805 line:80%
Don't contact him about me anymore.

01:01:12.473 --> 01:01:13.932 line:80%
He has nothing to do with me.

01:01:18.520 --> 01:01:20.022 line:80%
His phone's off.

01:01:22.650 --> 01:01:23.651 line:80%
[sighs]

01:01:25.402 --> 01:01:27.196 line:80%
[Chan] <i>I couldn't react properly.</i>

01:01:27.279 --> 01:01:28.947 line:80%
-[car honk echoes]
-[high-pitched ringing]

01:01:29.281 --> 01:01:31.408 line:80%
<i>It's hard to tell</i>
<i>where sounds are coming from.</i>

01:01:32.451 --> 01:01:33.452 line:80%
[sighs]

01:01:37.414 --> 01:01:39.166 line:80%
What is it? Where are you going?

01:01:40.209 --> 01:01:41.669 line:80%
Where are you going?

01:01:41.752 --> 01:01:44.046 line:80%
This patient was transferred

01:01:44.129 --> 01:01:46.715 line:80%
after a lab explosion in Boston
seven years ago.

01:01:46.799 --> 01:01:48.425 line:80%
He was treated for full-body burns,

01:01:48.509 --> 01:01:51.387 line:80%
and shrapnel is still lodged deep
in the temporal bone.

01:01:51.970 --> 01:01:55.265 line:80%
It's a high-risk area, so we are only
monitoring it at the moment.

01:01:55.349 --> 01:01:57.685 line:80%
He also has unilateral hearing loss.

01:01:57.768 --> 01:01:59.228 line:80%
Burns? Shrapnel?

01:01:59.311 --> 01:02:02.398 line:80%
He visited the ER recently
after a brief loss of consciousness

01:02:02.481 --> 01:02:03.899 line:80%
and minor bleeding.

01:02:03.983 --> 01:02:07.236 line:80%
The outpatient clinic will check
if it's related to the shrapnel.

01:02:07.319 --> 01:02:09.238 line:80%
That really is a difficult spot.

01:02:09.321 --> 01:02:10.364 line:80%
[presenter] That's right.

01:02:10.447 --> 01:02:13.033 line:80%
If his bleeding
was caused by the shrapnel,

01:02:13.117 --> 01:02:14.827 line:80%
it may be accompanied

01:02:14.910 --> 01:02:17.830 line:80%
by neurological symptoms
such as auditory or visual hallucinations.

01:02:17.913 --> 01:02:20.124 line:80%
There have even been reports
of memory distortion

01:02:20.207 --> 01:02:22.084 line:80%
<i>in severe cases like this.</i>

01:02:22.167 --> 01:02:24.294 line:80%
[♪ pensive music playing]

01:02:24.378 --> 01:02:26.922 line:80%
The patient with the shrapnel
in the temporal bone…

01:02:27.006 --> 01:02:28.173 line:80%
Did he take the exam?

01:02:28.757 --> 01:02:31.176 line:80%
No, it's past his appointment,
but he hasn't shown up.

01:02:32.720 --> 01:02:33.721 line:20%
But why do you ask?

01:02:33.804 --> 01:02:34.930 line:20%
SEONU CHAN

01:02:38.142 --> 01:02:39.268 line:80%
It's nothing.

01:02:39.768 --> 01:02:40.769 line:80%
[♪ music fades]

01:02:40.853 --> 01:02:42.187 line:80%
Mr. Park.

01:02:42.771 --> 01:02:44.356 line:80%
Mr. Park, did you see…

01:02:46.692 --> 01:02:47.693 line:80%
[sighs]

01:02:48.819 --> 01:02:50.821 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional music playing]

01:03:09.798 --> 01:03:11.008 line:80%
[Chan] <i>A three-month trial!</i>

01:03:11.091 --> 01:03:12.551 line:80%
Just try me out as a free trial.

01:03:12.634 --> 01:03:17.306 line:80%
As soon as the three months are over,
I'll disappear without a trace.

01:03:18.682 --> 01:03:19.933 line:80%
[breathing heavily]

01:03:24.688 --> 01:03:28.734 line:80%
END OF TRIAL

01:03:38.410 --> 01:03:39.411 line:80%
[♪ music ends]

01:03:41.080 --> 01:03:43.290 line:80%
We can proceed
with the model fitting as revised.

01:03:43.374 --> 01:03:44.875 line:80%
[Raemee] Spring is here!

01:03:44.958 --> 01:03:46.377 line:80%
Spring is here!

01:03:46.460 --> 01:03:47.628 line:80%
Spring is here!

01:03:47.711 --> 01:03:49.254 line:80%
Look, spring is here.

01:03:49.755 --> 01:03:52.591 line:80%
-The forsythias have started blooming.
-[Hayeong gasps]

01:03:53.050 --> 01:03:55.010 line:80%
The forsythias are blooming?

01:03:55.094 --> 01:03:57.221 line:80%
That means we're on a tight schedule.

01:03:57.304 --> 01:03:59.598 line:80%
All right, let's hang in there
for a few more days.

01:03:59.682 --> 01:04:00.808 line:80%
-Let's do this!
-Let's do this!

01:04:00.891 --> 01:04:03.644 line:80%
-Let's do this!
-I'm so sleepy.

01:04:03.727 --> 01:04:05.229 line:80%
-[Sol chuckles]
-[Raemee] Goodness.

01:04:05.312 --> 01:04:07.314 line:80%
[pen scraping]

01:04:10.150 --> 01:04:13.696 line:80%
[Haran] <i>The seasons of life</i>
<i>don't come in order.</i>

01:04:19.034 --> 01:04:20.035 line:80%
[sighs softly]

01:04:20.786 --> 01:04:22.246 line:80%
It really is spring.

01:04:25.290 --> 01:04:27.209 line:80%
<i>Sometimes, when you think it's spring,</i>

01:04:29.086 --> 01:04:31.005 line:80%
<i>winter suddenly arrives.</i>

01:04:36.385 --> 01:04:37.386 line:80%
<i>Take this.</i>

01:04:38.178 --> 01:04:39.179 line:80%
Oh…

01:04:40.180 --> 01:04:41.557 line:80%
Then let's do this.

01:04:41.640 --> 01:04:43.434 line:80%
It'll be like we're on a spring picnic.

01:04:44.310 --> 01:04:45.311 line:80%
Let's have fun.

01:04:47.396 --> 01:04:48.480 line:80%
[♪ soft emotional song playing]

01:05:14.381 --> 01:05:17.134 line:80%
SUMMER, SEVEN YEARS AGO
IT STARTED WITH WALLS

01:05:20.220 --> 01:05:22.222 line:80%
END OF TRIAL

01:05:24.308 --> 01:05:26.268 line:80%
[Haran] <i>The man</i>

01:05:26.935 --> 01:05:29.396 line:80%
<i>who suddenly lit up</i>
<i>my cold winter last year</i>

01:05:29.480 --> 01:05:31.148 line:80%
<i>like radiant spring sunlight…</i>

01:05:32.191 --> 01:05:35.027 line:80%
<i>disappeared from my life.</i>

01:06:00.552 --> 01:06:02.262 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:06:26.370 --> 01:06:28.497 line:20%
[Haran] <i>He disappeared.</i>

01:06:28.580 --> 01:06:31.959 line:20%
<i>The Seonu Chan I know</i>
<i>would never leave like this.</i>

01:06:32.543 --> 01:06:33.836 line:20%
[Sujin] <i>He disappeared because of me.</i>

01:06:33.919 --> 01:06:36.130 line:20%
<i>-I did something I shouldn't have.</i>
-[bracelet clinks]

01:06:36.213 --> 01:06:38.215 line:20%
He's been preparing for a long time.

01:06:38.298 --> 01:06:41.301 line:20%
<i>It's gotten so bad</i>
<i>that there's nothing they can do.</i>

01:06:41.385 --> 01:06:42.720 line:20%
-[Chan] <i>Do you remember…</i>
-[Haran cries]

01:06:42.803 --> 01:06:46.473 line:20%
<i>…how I was trapped in winter for so long?</i>

01:06:46.557 --> 01:06:48.392 line:20%
<i>I knew you'd understand</i>

01:06:49.685 --> 01:06:51.270 line:20%
<i>my sincerity.</i>

01:06:51.353 --> 01:06:53.439 line:20%
[Haran] <i>Seonu Chan, where are you?</i>

01:06:53.522 --> 01:06:55.691 line:20%
Where on earth are you?

01:06:58.777 --> 01:06:59.778 line:80%
[♪ song fades]

01:06:59.903 --> 01:07:01.905 line:80%
[♪ theme music playing]

01:07:07.745 --> 01:07:08.746 line:80%
IN YOUR RADIANT SEASON

01:07:08.829 --> 01:07:09.830 line:80%
Translated by Juyoung Park